# Do not add a global X-Frame-Options: Notion widgets are embedded cross-origin.
# Only hosts that read _headers apply this file (Cloudflare Pages, Netlify).
# GitHub Pages ignores it entirely, and also excludes _-prefixed files from the
# published output, so the canonical host must support _headers for these to take effect.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
